"""
IG Earnings Calendar — Logo Downloader (v2 — comprehensive)
Total companies: 1567

Downloads company logos using bare ticker names matching the calendar widget.
The calendar widget looks up: cdn.jsdelivr.net/.../logos/{TICKER}.png
So logos MUST be saved as {TICKER}.png (no _US, _UK, _DE suffixes).

Run via GitHub Actions (workflow_dispatch) or locally:
    python3 companies.py

Logos are saved to ../../logos/ relative to this script.

TICKER CONFLICTS (same bare ticker, different companies):
  BA  → BA. LN (BAE Systems) vs BA US (Boeing) — currently mapped to Boeing
  DG  → DG FP (Vinci) vs DG US (Dollar General) — currently mapped to Vinci
  JD  → JD. LN (JD Sports) vs JD US (JD.com) — currently mapped to JD Sports
  SRE → SRE GR (Sirius RE) vs SRE US (Sempra) — currently mapped to Sirius RE
Swap the domain if the other company appears more often in your calendar.
"""

